# Glyph legend for .level files.
#
# Each line maps ONE glyph to a brick's two u8 tile halves (left, right).
# Multiple glyphs may map to the same tile pair so you can pick whichever
# renders best in your editor.
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#
# Format: <glyph> <whitespace> <left> <whitespace> <right>
#
# glyph  left              right
.        TILE_EMPTY_1      TILE_EMPTY_2
B        TILE_BLUE_1       TILE_BLUE_2
R        TILE_RED_1        TILE_RED_2
G        TILE_GREEN_1      TILE_GREEN_2
Y        TILE_YELLOW_1     TILE_YELLOW_2
O        TILE_BROWN_1      TILE_BROWN_2
A        TILE_GRAY_1       TILE_GRAY_2
P        TILE_PURPLE_1     TILE_PURPLE_2
K        TILE_PINK_1       TILE_PINK_2
M        TILE_SMILE_1      TILE_SMILE_2
T        TILE_TITANIUM_1   TILE_TITANIUM_2
I        TILE_IRIS_1       TILE_IRIS_2
S        TILE_SHIELD_1     TILE_SHIELD_2
